f caught in a web of lies, deceit and murder. This movie is based on \\\"Chinatown\\\" (1974) by Roman Polanski, with the basic premise being similar to the original, despite changes in the representation of characters and some key plot points. In a cinema-noir\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d01\", \"text\": \"Six Feet Under (band) Six Feet Under is an American death metal band from Tampa, Florida, formed in 1993. The band consists of five members: founding vocalist Chris Barnes, guitarists Ray Suhy and Jack Owen, bassist Jeff Hughell and drummer Marco Pitruzzella. It was originally a side project formed by Barnes with guitarist Allen West of Obituary, but became a full-time commitment after Barnes was dismissed from Cannibal Corpse in 1995. They have released twelve albums, and are listed by Nielsen Soundscan as the fourth best-selling death metal act in the U.S., with album sales over 370,000 (sales numbers are\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d02\", \"text\": \"Amazon.in Enter the characters you see below Sorry , we just need to make sure you 're not a robot . For best results , please make sure your browser is accepting cookies . Type the characters you see in this image : Try different image Continue shopping Conditions of Use & Sale Privacy Notice © 1996-2015 , Amazon.com , Inc. or its affiliates\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [\"Drama\", \"Medical Drama\"], \"prior_explanation\": \"The show focuses on themes like life, death, and family within a funeral home setting, commonly categorized as drama or medical drama.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0268-063158a9c150:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Six Feet Under\", \"scope\": \"genre\", \"claim\": \"The genre of \\\"Six Feet Under\\\" is a neo-noir thriller.\", \"answer\": \"neo-noir thriller\", \"quote\": \"Manorama Six Feet Under Manorama Six Feet Under is a 2007 Indian neo-noir thriller film directed and co-written by Navdeep Singh.\",